This paper shares fatal flaws with low-scoring benchmarks: its core “novel benchmark’’ claim is invalid, its explainability contribution fails its own criteria, and trust claims are unevidenced. The key empirical finding (GBDT collapse) is presented as a side note rather than analyzed. Clear writing and the intriguing generalization gap are insufficient to overcome structural overclaiming and missing investigation. Relative to anchors, the paper ranks well below the accepted medium baseline and aligns with rejected papers that overstate contributions.

